  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "cty_c",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -334
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Night city\n\nA city from above, from one subdivision. Cells (`subdivide`) splits the ground into blocks with streets between them (`gap`). A ForEach visits every block: a height (tall downtown, low at the edges, a few parks), a roof from Path Ops (`offset`), its shadow thrown along the sun's direction by that height, and lit windows scattered on the roof. Cars are Trim Path pieces running round every block's street (`each`, `offset` driven by time), street lamps sit at even steps along them, and after dark everything that glows goes through bloom.\n\n• Slider into `tod`: time of day (with the toggle off).  • Toggle: run the clock (a day in 40 s).\n• Slider into `depth`: how finely the city divides.  • Vary: a new city.",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 270
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Night city\n\nA city from above, from one subdivision. Cells (`subdivide`) splits the ground into blocks with streets between them (`gap`). A ForEach visits every block: a height (tall downtown, low at the edges, a few parks), a roof from Path Ops (`offset`), its shadow thrown along the sun's direction by that height, and lit windows scattered on the roof. Cars are Trim Path pieces running round every block's street (`each`, `offset` driven by time), street lamps sit at even steps along them, and after dark everything that glows goes through bloom.\n\n• Slider into `tod`: time of day (with the toggle off).  • Toggle: run the clock (a day in 40 s).\n• Slider into `depth`: how finely the city divides.  • Vary: a new city.",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 270
      }
    },
